@startuml US229-SSD

actor "Backoffice Operator" as BO
participant "AISafe System" as System

BO -> System : GET /api/flight-routes/reports/utilization

alt Missing JWT or Insufficient Role
    System --> BO : 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden
else valid request
    System --> BO : 200 OK\nList<RouteUtilizationDTO>\n(sorted by popularity + HATEOAS links)
end

@enduml